## [2026-07-09] Hide /subscription untuk tenant sales (self-service flag)

**Author:** synckerja-web (CMS admin)  
**Status apply Supabase:** Sudah apply  

### Ringkasan

Menambah kolom `organizations.subscription_self_service_enabled` (default `true`) agar CMS dapat menandai tenant sales (`false`). Saat `false`, **synckerja office** harus menyembunyikan seluruh modul `/subscription` untuk semua role termasuk Owner, sambil tetap memblokir akses saat subscription expired.

### File migration

| File | Jenis |
|------|-------|
| `supabase/migrations/20260709210000_organizations_subscription_self_service.sql` | ADD column |
| `supabase/migrations/20260709210100_admin_organization_settings_rpc.sql` | ADD RPC + extend `admin_list_organizations` |

### Objek database

**Kolom baru**
- `public.organizations.subscription_self_service_enabled` — `boolean NOT NULL DEFAULT true`

**RPC baru / diubah**
- `admin_update_organization_settings(p_organization_id, p_subscription_self_service_enabled, p_reason)` — guard `is_cms_admin()`, audit ke `cms_subscription_adjustments` (`before_state`/`after_state` berisi flag)
- `admin_list_organizations(...)` — return tambahan `subscription_self_service_enabled`

### Dampak ke synckerja (office) — **wajib implementasi Fase 3**

- **Perlu review + ubah kode office** (lihat handoff di bawah)
- RLS existing pada `organizations`: **tidak diubah**
- Kolom baru dibaca office via `CentralizedUserDataContext` — select `subscription_self_service_enabled` dari `organizations`
- Default `true` untuk org existing (backfill implisit) dan self-register onboarding

### Handoff Fase 3 — synckerja office

1. **Baca flag org** — extend `CentralizedUserDataContext` select `subscription_self_service_enabled`; hook `useSubscriptionSelfServiceEnabled(): boolean` (default `true` jika belum load)
2. **Sembunyikan navigasi** — filter item `subscription` di `navConfig` / `AppSidebar` jika `false`; parity mobile
3. **Block route (termasuk Owner)** — helper `isSubscriptionModulePath(path)`; cek flag **sebelum** owner bypass di `useDepartmentAccess.canAccessPage`; `SubscriptionRoleGuard` redirect ke `/` jika `false`
4. **Banner** — `useSubscriptionExpiryBanner` / `SubscriptionExpiryBannerSlot` / `MobileSubscriptionExpiryBannerHost` jangan render jika `false`
5. **Expiry guard tetap aktif** — `SubscriptionExpiryGuard` masih blokir saat expired; `isAllowedWhenExpired` untuk sales tenant **tidak** whitelist `/subscription/plans` & `/subscription/management`
6. **Expired page copy** — `SubscriptionExpiredPage`: pesan "Hubungi tim Synckerja untuk perpanjangan" tanpa CTA ke plans
7. **Onboarding** — `OrganizationForm` insert explicit `subscription_self_service_enabled: true`

**Path yang disembunyikan:** `/subscription`, `/subscription/overview`, `/subscription/plans`, `/subscription/management`

### Yang harus dilakukan tim synckerja

1. Copy 2 file migration ke `supabase/migrations/` repo synckerja
2. Apply ke Supabase shared (jika belum dari synckerja-web)
3. Implement Fase 3 di office (nav, guard, banner, expiry policy, expired copy)
4. Test: tenant mandiri (`true`) vs sales (`false`), expired block, CMS toggle + audit

